										<div class="elementor-repeater-item-45af3dc swiper-slide" role="group" aria-roledescription="slide"><div class="swiper-slide-bg elementor-ken-burns elementor-ken-burns--in" role="img" aria-label="8120106051_e63c0959b5_h"></div><div class="elementor-background-overlay"></div><div class="swiper-slide-inner" ><div class="swiper-slide-contents"><div class="elementor-slide-heading">Senate schedule</div><div class="elementor-slide-description">Other than pro forma sessions on Tuesday, November 24th at 3:00 p.m. and Friday, November 27th at 12:00 noon, the Senate stands adjourned until 3:00 p.m. on Monday, November 30th.  There is one vote that evening at 5:30 p.m.</div></div></div></div>				</div>
